{"id":"n40078-1-11","stage":1,"title":"기쁘다 · 高兴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40078-1-11-1","ko":"우리가 이렇게 다시 만나게 되어서 정말 기뻐요.","zh":"能像这样再次见面，我真的好开心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，再次","explanation":"다시：再，再次。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"1","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}},{"text":"만나게","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나게","audio":"/audio/28cdc2f859e0522c7a48.mp3"}},{"text":"되어서","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"8","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되어서","audio":"/audio/8e3aef8ff8db2c97fe96.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{